# vendor/ is intentionally NOT ignored: phpoffice/phpword (+ its phpoffice/math
# dependency) is vendored directly from GitHub releases so this plugin
# activates without requiring `composer install` first. If you regenerate
# vendor/ via a real `composer install`, review the diff before committing —
# a real install may pull newer versions or additional transitive files.
